{"3926730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dorothy's Job", "steam_appid": 3926730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926730/extras/03f99ff609e92176bd7688161d9f0104.avif?t=1765824068\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Dorothy</strong>, the overly muscular maid of an evil mastermind, in a hilarious <strong>isometric twin-stick shooter</strong> where cleaning is just as deadly as combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, Dorothy must face a brand-new, randomly generated level overflowing with enemies and filth. Your goal: <strong>clean everything</strong>—sweep away villains and mop up messes using an arsenal of outrageous cleaning tools turned into powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your trusty mop, unleash the destructive power of a vacuum cleaner, and discover other cleaning gadgets reimagined as instruments of mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect of Dorothy's Job?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Chaos</strong> – Each day brings new layouts, enemies, and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleaning Tools of Destruction</strong> – Wield mops, vacuums, and more as deadly weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a One Woman Army</strong>– Play as Dorothy, a maid who’s as strong as she is unstoppable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Meets Comedy</strong> – Over-the-top twin-stick action with a tongue-in-cheek sense of humor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re scrubbing floors or blasting foes, <strong>Dorothy’s Job</strong> proves that cleaning can be messy, chaotic, and ridiculously fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in colaboration with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926730/extras/ad799368acf4105c429ae7ffbff31e10.avif?t=1765824068\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926730/extras_big/ad799368acf4105c429ae7ffbff31e10.webp?t=1765824068 width=1560 height=247 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926730/extras/03f99ff609e92176bd7688161d9f0104.avif?t=1765824068\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Dorothy</strong>, the overly muscular maid of an evil mastermind, in a hilarious <strong>isometric twin-stick shooter</strong> where cleaning is just as deadly as combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, Dorothy must face a brand-new, randomly generated level overflowing with enemies and filth. Your goal: <strong>clean everything</strong>—sweep away villains and mop up messes using an arsenal of outrageous cleaning tools turned into powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your trusty mop, unleash the destructive power of a vacuum cleaner, and discover other cleaning gadgets reimagined as instruments of mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect of Dorothy's Job?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Chaos</strong> – Each day brings new layouts, enemies, and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleaning Tools of Destruction</strong> – Wield mops, vacuums, and more as deadly weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a One Woman Army</strong>– Play as Dorothy, a maid who’s as strong as she is unstoppable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Meets Comedy</strong> – Over-the-top twin-stick action with a tongue-in-cheek sense of humor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re scrubbing floors or blasting foes, <strong>Dorothy’s Job</strong> proves that cleaning can be messy, chaotic, and ridiculously fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in colaboration with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926730/extras/ad799368acf4105c429ae7ffbff31e10.avif?t=1765824068\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926730/extras_big/ad799368acf4105c429ae7ffbff31e10.webp?t=1765824068 width=1560 height=247 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A frenetic and hilarious isometric twin-stick shooter where you play as Dorothy, a muscular maid who is in charge of cleaning levels full of enemies and filth with deadly mops, vacuums, and outrageous cleaning tools.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926730/5d3ad0ccd6e8a200d882e09a4edb86c704656819/header.jpg?t=1765824068", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926730/e1363e819e36ee374d21d3e133a212bddcf23c35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765824068", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926730/e1363e819e36ee374d21d3e133a212bddcf23c35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765824068", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 3.70 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong>